Dear All,

Last time, we concluded our meeting with the agreement that us, local organizers, would come up with a preliminary budget by the end of September.

According to our calculations, the expected costs associated with the workshop will total around 4300 EUR, which includes room and catering costs for the workshop, as well as transport, accommodation, meals and per diem for Marc and Michael.

We propose a two-tier system for registration fees based on country of origin: 120 EUR for participants from Western EU countries and 60 EUR for Eastern EU ones.  We anticipate at least 10 participants from each of these regions, totalling  to approx. 1800 EUR.

The reamining costs will be covered by a grant from Zoltan Barta.

We also talked about  a preliiminary round of advertising in December and a follow up in January or February with a final decision to be made about the feasibility (financial viability) of the workshop in late March/early April.

Please let us know if this sounds reasonable and if you have any suggestions with regards to registration fee pricing or any other parts of the preparation.

Best wishes,

